<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>LOA Request Rejected — HPCMS</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 32px 16px; }
    .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 32px; }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #111; margin-top: 0; }
    p { color: #444; line-height: 1.6; }
    .ref { font-family: monospace; background: #f0f0f0; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; }
    .reason-box { background: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
    .footer { color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>LOA Request Rejected <span class="badge">Rejected</span></h1>
    <p>Hello {{patientName}},</p>
    <p>We regret to inform you that your Letter of Authorization (LOA) request has been reviewed and <strong>rejected</strong>.</p>
    <p>Reference: <span class="ref">{{caseRef}}</span></p>
    {{#if reason}}
    <div class="reason-box">
      <strong>Reason:</strong><br />{{reason}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    <p>If you believe this is an error or would like to submit a new request, please log in to your HPCMS account or contact our support team.</p>
    <p class="footer">This is an automated message from HPCMS. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
